  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Livestock-based small-scale farmingsystems in the Mekong Region 2013-2017 - Livestock-based small-scale farmingsystems</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sm&#xe5;skaligt husdjursbaserat jordbruk i Mekong-</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Forskningsn&#xe4;tverk fokuserat p&#xe5; sm&#xe5;skaligt husdjursbaserat jordbruk i  Mekong-regionen. St&#xf6;d ges till en forskningsfond, PhD- och            MSc-utbildning samt n&#xe4;tverkande.Svensk samarbetspartner &#xe4;r Sveriges   Lantbruksuniversitet.St&#xf6;det &#xe4;r 30 miljoner kr under &#xe5;ren 2013-2017.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Small scale livestock based farming systems research network in the   Mekong-region. Support to a Research Fund, MSc- and PhD-training and  networking activities.Swedish cooperation partner is the Swedish      Agricultural University. The support is 30 million SEK for 2013-2017.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve livelihood and food security of the people and environment in the lower Mekong basin through sustainable management and use of available resources.</narrative>
  </description>
